<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ashton year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ashton year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    28.33 vs 41.95</p>
<p>    Net				     20.57 vs 16.76</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     3.0  vs 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Ashton Mining Ltd is a diamond producer and is about 46.95 percent owned by Malaysia Mining Corp Bhd.</p>
</text>
